<title>USA: USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</title>
<headline>USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hide and offal value from a typical slaughter steer for Friday was estimated at 9.66 per cwt live, down 0.01 from Thursday's value. - USDA</p>
<p>FOB CENTRAL U.S., TODAY'S CALCULATIONS FOR BY-PRODUCT</p>
